Help_Text_AnswerPlayingForFirstTime::
	.string "You become the main character,\n"
	.string "exploring the world of DAEMON. By\l"
	.string "talking to people and solving mysteries,\l"
	.string "new paths will open to you. Strive for\l"
	.string "the goal together with your wonderful\l"
	.string "DAEMON.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatShouldIBeDoing::
	.string "When you come across another person,\n"
	.string "go up to them and press the A Button.\l"
	.string "That will get them to talk and interact\l"
	.string "with your character. You may also\l"
	.string "examine various items and objects in\l"
	.string "the same way. Talk to people and check\l"
	.string "things often to obtain information.$"

Help_Text_AnswerCantGetOutOfRoom::
	.string "On the stairs or the exits of a\n"
	.string "building is a red mat. Move your\l"
	.string "character to stand on top of the\l"
	.string "red mat. Press the {PLUS} Control Pad \l"
	.string "toward the stairs or the exit to\l"
	.string "advance.$"

Help_Text_AnswerCantFindPersonIWant::
	.string "This isn't something you should worry about\n"
	.string "too much. Talk to other people, check signs,\l"
	.string "check things, and so on. Sometimes, you may\l"
	.string "need to just move to a new town or\l"
	.string "place.$"

Help_Text_AnswerTalkedToEveryoneNowWhat::
	.string "Try moving on to a new road, town, or\n"
	.string "place.$"

Help_Text_AnswerSomeoneBlockingMyWay::
	.string "There could be something in the town\n"
	.string "or inside a building that is the cause.\l"
	.string "Try talking to the people in the area\l"
	.string "again. If there is a problem that they\l"
	.string "need solved, you may have to help.\l"
	.string "Afterwards, try talking to the person\l"
	.string "blocking your way again.$"

Help_Text_AnswerICantGoOn::
	.string "Try talking to people by going up to\n"
	.string "them and pressing the A Button.\l"
	.string "Also, try checking things like odd trees\l"
	.string "and strange rocks with the A Button.\l"
	.string "Press the {PLUS} Control Pad and try going\l"
	.string "to places that look impassable, too.$"

Help_Text_AnswerOutOfThingsToDo::
	.string "Try going to places where you \n"
	.string "haven't visited yet.\l"
	.string "Also, check everything that looks\l"
	.string "suspicious by pressing the A Button.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatHappenedToItemIGot::
	.string "Any item that you are given by another\n"
	.string "character goes in your BAG.\l"
	.string "The item is automatically sorted and\l"
	.string "placed in one of three pockets.\l"
	.string "For instructions on the BAG's use,\l"
	.string "please refer to the HELP System's\l"
	.string "“How do I do this?” heading.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatAreMyAdventureBasics::
	.string "If DAEMONS are hurt in battle, take\n"
	.string "them to a CHECKPOINT and have them\l"
	.string "healed by the staff. Get in the habit\l"
	.string "of saving your game and recording your\l"
	.string "progress. Stock up on healing items at\l"
	.string "REPOS before traveling far.$"

Help_Text_AnswerHowAreRoadsForestsDifferent::
	.string "Forests are basically the same as\n"
	.string "roads but they can be like mazes.\l"
	.string "All forests have a way out, so don't\l"
	.string "give up if you get lost.$"

Help_Text_AnswerHowAreCavesDifferent::
	.string "Caves are dark and dangerous. Wild\n"
	.string "DAEMON can appear anywhere in them. If\l"
	.string "there is an emergency, rush to a\l"
	.string "CHECKPOINT or use items. New towns\l"
	.string "await discovery beyond some caves, so\l"
	.string "don't give up.$"

Help_Text_AnswerHowDoIProgress::
	.string "The object of the game is to train\n"
	.string "your DAEMON and move forward. You must\l"
	.string "collect info and solve problems. For\l"
	.string "example, what do you need to get\l"
	.string "around an obstacle? What would get\l"
	.string "that impeding person out of the way?$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhenCanIUseItem::
	.string "There are several kinds of items.\n"
	.string "Some can be used only on the field.\l"
	.string "Some are only for use during battle.\l"
	.string "Some can be used anytime.\l"
	.string "Try using an item - if it can't be used,\l"
	.string "you will be alerted.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatsABattle::
	.string "In a battle, DAEMON try to reduce one\n"
	.string "another's vitality, expressed as HP. If\l"
	.string "a DAEMON's HP falls to zero, it HALTS,\l"
	.string "and the other DAEMONS wins. By winning\l"
	.string "a battle, DAEMON earn EXP. Points,\l"
	.string "which help them level up (grow\l"
	.string "stronger).$"

Help_Text_AnswerHowDoIPrepareForBattle::
	.string "First, fully heal the DAEMON in your\n"
	.string "party (the DAEMON with you) at any\l"
	.string "CHECKPOINT. You should also buy\l"
	.string "healing items for emergencies at a\l"
	.string "REPO.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatIsAMonsVitality::
	.string "A DAEMON's vitality is expressed in HP.\n"
	.string "If a DAEMON is hurt in battle, HP is\l"
	.string "subtracted. If its HP drops to zero,\l"
	.string "the DAEMON HALTS. Heal hurt or HALTED\l"
	.string "DAEMON at a CHECKPOINT or by using\l"
	.string "items.$"

Help_Text_AnswerMyMonsAreHurt::
	.string "A CHECKPOINT is like an inn for DAEMON.\n"
	.string "It will fully heal DAEMON of any status\l"
	.string "problems and fully restore their HP\l"
	.string "using a special machine. This service is\l"
	.string "free, so get in the habit of healing\l"
	.string "your DAEMON often.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatIsStatusProblem::
	.string "A status problem refers to an ailment\n"
	.string "that is inflicted on a DAEMON by its\l"
	.string "foe's attack. These include\l"
	.string "throttling, leaking, suspension, and\l"
	.string "overheating and hanging. Heal\l"
	.string "them at a CHECKPOINT or with the\l"
	.string "appropriate item.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatHappensIfAllMyMonsFaint::
	.string "If all the DAEMONS in your party (all\n"
	.string "the DAEMON with you) HALT, you lose\l"
	.string "some MONEY, and you are returned home\l"
	.string "or to a CHECKPOINT. To reduce that\l"
	.string "chance, visit CHECKPOINTS often. Also,\l"
	.string "get in the habit of saving often.$"

Help_Text_AnswerCantCatchMons::
	.string "If a wild DAEMON escapes from a POKé\n"
	.string "BOX, it's obviously still feisty. Try\l"
	.string "reducing its HP some more, and try to\l"
	.string "throttle it or suspend it\l"
	.string "before trying to bind it. If the POKé\l"
	.string "BOX rocks for a while, the quarry is\l"
	.string "close to being bound!$"

Help_Text_AnswerRanOutOfPotions::
	.string "There are shops, known as REPOS, that\n"
	.string "sell items. You will not find REPOS on\l"
	.string "roads, in forests, or in caves. Stock up\l"
	.string "on needed items while you are visiting\l"
	.string "a town with a REPO.$"

Help_Text_AnswerCanIBuyPokeBalls::
	.string "You may buy BOXES at any REPO in\n"
	.string "any town. You will not find REPOS on\l"
	.string "roads, in forests, or in caves. Stock up\l"
	.string "on BOXES while you are visiting a\l"
	.string "town with a REPO.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatsATrainer::
	.string "A USER is a person who raises DAEMON\n"
	.string "through battling. USERS will challenge\l"
	.string "you wherever they are - it could be on\l"
	.string "a road, in forests, caves, anywhere. If\l"
	.string "your eyes meet, you have to accept\l"
	.string "their challenge. So be careful!$"

Help_Text_AnswerHowDoIWinAgainstTrainer::
	.string "To beat a USER in battle, use DAEMON\n"
	.string "that have type advantages over the\l"
	.string "foe's DAEMON. You may also use\l"
	.string "highly trained DAEMON with overwhelming\l"
	.string "power. Outnumbering the foe's DAEMON\l"
	.string "is another obvious tactic.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhereDoMonsAppear::
	.string "Wild DAEMON will appear in tall grass,\n"
	.string "on roads, and in forests. They will\l"
	.string "appear anywhere in dark caves. There\l"
	.string "are no wild DAEMONS or USERS in towns,\l"
	.string "so they are safe places.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatAreMoves::
	.string "DAEMON may learn up to four different\n"
	.string "techniques, or ROUTINES. There is a great\l"
	.string "variety of ROUTINES including attacks and\l"
	.string "those with special effects. The kinds of\l"
	.string "ROUTINES that can be learned vary for each\l"
	.string "DAEMON. Some ROUTINES can be learned from\l"
	.string "machines.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatAreHiddenMoves::
	.string "HIDDEN ROUTINES are those that are\n"
	.string "especially important for your adventure. To\l"
	.string "invoke such a ROUTINE outside of battle,\l"
	.string "open the “DAEMON” MENU and make the DAEMON\l"
	.string "that knows the ROUTINE invoke it. A HALTED\l"
	.string "DAEMON may invoke a HIDDEN ROUTINE outside\l"
	.string "battle.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatMovesShouldIUse::
	.string "Select “INVOKE,” and the MENU of\n"
	.string "routines will appear. Consider the\l"
	.string "type matchups, and use the most\l"
	.string "effective ones. You can check the\l"
	.string "effects of a routine by opening\l"
	.string "“DAEMON,” picking one, opening\l"
	.string "“SUMMARY,” then “DAEMON SKILLS.”$"

Help_Text_AnswerWantToAddMoreMoves::
	.string "The most a DAEMON can learn is four\n"
	.string "ROUTINES. They are learned as the DAEMON\l"
	.string "levels up. It can also be taught a ROUTINE\l"
	.string "using a TM (Technical Machine) or HM (Hidden\l"
	.string "Machine). There are also people who teach\l"
	.string "ROUTINES.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWantToMakeMonStronger::
	.string "The key to making your DAEMON strong is\n"
	.string "to battle and win often. The EXP.\l"
	.string "(Experience) Points earned by winning\l"
	.string "battles accumulate to level up DAEMON\l"
	.string "that participated in them. Battle wild\l"
	.string "DAEMON often to level up your party.$"

Help_Text_AnswerFoeMonsTooStrong::
	.string "If your foe are too strong, try\n"
	.string "leveling up your DAEMON some more. Go\l"
	.string "back the way you came and battle wild\l"
	.string "DAEMON to level up your party. You\l"
	.string "may also battle USERS whom you have\l"
	.string "not battled before.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatDoIDoInCave::
	.string "Unlike roads and forests, wild DAEMON\n"
	.string "can appear anywhere in caves. If your\l"
	.string "DAEMONS are hurt in a cave, rush to a\l"
	.string "CHECKPOINT or use items to heal them\l"
	.string "right away. It is very dangerous to\l"
	.string "force your luck in caves.$"

Help_Text_AnswerNothingIWantToKnow::
	.string "Trust your own knowledge and power.\n"
	.string "Believe in yourself and find your way!$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatsPokemonCenter::
	.string "A CHECKPOINT is identified by its red\n"
	.string "roof and a “P.C” sign. Every\l"
	.string "CHECKPOINT offers such services as\l"
	.string "fully healing DAEMON and free PORT\l"
	.string "use, making it essential for your\l"
	.string "travels. On the upper floor are\l"
	.string "facilities for linking with friends and\l"
	.string "others.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatsPokemonMart::
	.string "A REPO is identified by its blue roof\n"
	.string "and a “MART” sign. Items can be bought\l"
	.string "and sold at any REPO. Some MARTS carry\l"
	.string "items that are available only in their\l"
	.string "towns.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWantToEndGame::
	.string "You can safely end your game by\n"
	.string "selecting “SAVE” on the MENU.\l"
	.string "Once you have saved, the game can be\l"
	.string "safely turned off. When the game is\l"
	.string "turned back on, you can resume from\l"
	.string "where you last saved.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatsAMon::
	.string "DAEMONS are living beings about which\n"
	.string "many mysteries still remain. You may\l"
	.string "see them in grass, the sea, and caves.\l"
	.string "They appear to obey the wishes of the\l"
	.string "USERS that bound them.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatIsThatPersonLike::
	.string "Use the HEARSAY among the KEY ITEMS\n"
	.string "in your BAG. It may give you a hint, so\l"
	.string "try it out.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatDoesHiddenMoveDo::
	.string "A HIDDEN ROUTINE is taught to a DAEMON\n"
	.string "using an HM (Hidden Machine). A HIDDEN\l"
	.string "ROUTINE is important for helping your\l"
	.string "adventure. For example, one is used to light\l"
	.string "up dark caves. Another cuts down small\l"
	.string "trees. There is one for traveling on water,\l"
	.string "and so on.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatDoIDoInSafari::
	.string "Try to bind wild DAEMON by throwing the\n"
	.string "special GUESTBOXES. You may keep any\l"
	.string "item you find, too.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatAreSafariRules::
	.string "Your SAFARI GAME ends once you have\n"
	.string "traveled a certain distance or thrown\l"
	.string "all your GUESTBOXES. Open the MENU to\l"
	.string "check the remaining number of steps and\l"
	.string "GUESTBOXES.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWantToEndSafari::
	.string "If you would like to cut your SAFARI\n"
	.string "GAME short, open the MENU and select\l"
	.string "“RETIRE” at the top of the list.$"

Help_Text_AnswerWhatIsAGym::
	.string "DAEMON GYMS are operated by the\n"
	.string "DAEMON LEAGUE and are training\l"
	.string "facilities for USERS. They are all\l"
	.string "across the land in cities and towns.\l"
	.string "Each one is headed by a LEADER, who is\l"
	.string "a very skilled USER. Beat the LEADER\l"
	.string "to collect a MARK.$"

